OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after fire on 17th floor
OL,4,Aof tower block
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died in a flat fire on the
OL,7,F17th floor of a residential tower block
OL,8,Fin east London, the London Fire Brigade
OL,9,F(LFB) has said.
OL,11,FIts investigation team is looking at "a
OL,12,Frange of factors" regarding the cause
OL,13,Fof the blaze, which broke out at the
OL,14,F22-storey Neutron Tower on Blackwall
OL,15,FWay in Poplar in the early hours of
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,18,FAn LFB spokesperson added: "Two adults
OL,19,Fand one child were rescued by
OL,20,Ffirefighters wearing breathing
OL,21,Fapparatus. Sadly, a man was declared
OL,22,Fdead at the scene."
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
